<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">touch</ansi>

Lay your hand on something in the room. Most things do nothing when touched,
but some places are built to be worked by hand, and the order you touch
things in can matter. Look closely first.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">touch pillar</ansi>
  Touch the pillar.
